=== FirstClassFunctions Sample ===
--- Expression Lambda ---
doubler(5)=10
doubler(0)=0
--- Multi-Param Lambda ---
adder(3,4)=7
--- Zero-Param Lambda ---
greeter()=Hello, Mist!
--- Block Lambda ---
describer(5)=positive
describer(-1)=negative
describer(0)=zero
--- Var Inference ---
square(6)=36
--- Action Lambda ---
printed: test
--- Higher-Order Parameter ---
Apply(10, x=>x+5)=15
--- Higher-Order Return ---
multiplier(7)=21
multiplier(0)=0
--- Method Group ---
fn(42)=-42
promoted()=item-6
--- Type Alias ---
isEven(4)=True
isEven(7)=False
toStr(99)=val=99
--- Capture ---
increment()=1
increment()=2
counter=2
--- Static Lambda ---
staticAdd(10,20)=30
--- Nested Func Type ---
add5(3)=8
curryAdd(1)(2)=3
--- Sync Lambda Calls Async ---
syncLookup(1)=item-1
syncLookup(2)=item-2
--- Async Lambda Explicit Await ---
asyncLookup(3)=item-3
--- Async Lambda Scope Exit ---
asyncFire completed
--- Sync Lambda Async Lift ---
liftedSync(10)=20
--- Async Lambda Async Lift ---
asyncLifted(20)=40
--- Sync Lambda Returns Task ---
taskReturner(5)=item-5
--- Mist Extension Method ---
evens.Length=2
evens[0]=2
evens[1]=4
--- C# Extension Method ---
item=10
item=20
item=30
--- Discarded Lambda Result ---
noted 8
--- Void Lambda At Inferred Result ---
note: expression body
note: block body
voidCall=Void voidBlock=Void
=== FirstClassFunctions Done ===
